{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f830e3ffe1eb95ced991d9df235df4a5f23d51e3177bcc3179d3366c1562cd3c", "ja": "（先日、杏奈から手作りのチョコをもらった。\nお礼と感想を伝えたいんだけど……どこにいるかな？）", "zh": "（前几天收到了杏奈亲手做的巧克力。想向她道谢并告诉她感想……她在哪儿呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1001_p", "source_sha256": "57f5cc7bf2ff5ff5ff3a1e39d6f718db4e4ba0d93c461d6f5a39abec01a1b84a", "ja": "お疲れ様、杏奈。この前もらったチョコだけど、\n本当においしかったよ、ありがとう。", "zh": "辛苦了，杏奈。关于你之前送我的巧克力，真的很好吃，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "5abb5c9d06fef12406f365f6baf06acfc479d65cd06febe654709c5382588ef4", "ja": "えへへ……よかった……♪\nおいしくできたかなって、少し心配だったから……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……太好了……♪\n因为我还有点担心，不知道做得好不好吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a545e6bfcb4d5220255967984d1e3c53fbb85d05394977379723c0fff79a456d", "ja": "そうだったのか。あっ。\nチョコに書いてあったメッセージも嬉しかったよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。啊，巧克力上写的留言也让我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "da1546a5b1af1779e181b708357b227c724bc5fc8e2b2856451f4890a3a92df3", "ja": "ん……それなら、大成功です……♪\n劇場のみんなの分も、作ったけど……。", "zh": "嗯……那样的话，就大成功了……♪\n虽然剧场大家的份，我也都做了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "540da3f84d31c31a82615f8e9930fb3802002e7332264f3bfcd8c19f618a0dee", "ja": "全部……メッセージが、違うんだよ……。\nもちろん、{$P$}さんのも……。", "zh": "全部……写的留言，都不一样哦……。\n当然也有{$P$}先生的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ef16a1b925b326c3adfb4c1fdd8ee2759f65dbc4f71d6163b3bd6b44d9918ec0", "ja": "そうだったのか。惜しいことをしたな……。\nゆっくり食べればよかった。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。真可惜……\n要是慢慢吃就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "350ac2001e23281ccfe6389e031169175e9bacd1d6c226fa4de271c56f5296cb", "ja": "んと……{$P$}さん、\nもっと、チョコ食べたい……の？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生，\n还想吃……更多巧克力……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "c9ee1d645079e04e960fe51e9f2e6e1777da264b9956d537d5a954d85730e186", "ja": "杏奈、チョコ作り……楽しかった、から……。\nまた、作っても……いいよ？", "zh": "因为杏奈做巧克力……很开心……所以……\n还可以再做……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1009_p", "source_sha256": "26aca5ece523bddd89b4d23240add7d92d3be9dd3cee5bd294096f64e9e9b799", "ja": "えっ。いいのか？", "zh": "咦，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "f92f7feca3c409ff6b0e0deff275788303cb9eb5b88acd0c3ac15dca6e4568b5", "ja": "うん……。\nおいしかったって……言って、くれたから……。", "zh": "嗯……\n因为……你说过，很好吃嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "b695178b619d496227ea6c53a9392b0e592d61841de2ec92f4831fadd1b93845", "ja": "今なら、もっとおいしいの、作れるかも……。\n杏奈も……料理のレベル、上がってるから……♪", "zh": "现在的话，说不定能做出更好吃的……。\n因为杏奈的料理水平……也提高了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "c7a2a113ace0373698951caeac5e30ace6011ff9d65ca75ae317fe97141770a3", "ja": "今回のチョコは……普通の味、だったし……。\n次は……変わったのに、しようかな……？", "zh": "这次的巧克力……是普通的味道……  \n下次要不要……做点特别的呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6b24acf3f7b3398c084a83fe4b0472266d475e96fc3c5cd8443a5c2b3e3302ea", "ja": "変わった味か……。\nどんなチョコができるか、気になってきたな。", "zh": "特别的味道啊……\n让人开始期待会做出什么样的巧克力了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "cdc0d5a5e4923f686c45ec15498326202c326b1b83fbc17702c23771afc97210", "ja": "ん……任せて……。{$P$}さんには\n大人っぽいのが、いいかも……。", "zh": "嗯……交给我吧……。给{$P$}先生做成熟风的，或许不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0543_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "2f611674ef2c374812a48afcfe21d849855a467ff40aa3c5a86deae210017271", "ja": "ビターなチョコと、一緒に……甘いのも、\nセットで……。杏奈と一緒に、食べようね……♪", "zh": "苦涩的巧克力，还有甜的……一起作为套餐……和杏奈一起吃吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
